Third-party notices
--------------------

This project bundles or adapts the following third-party work. None of it is
redistributed as source; each is either an npm dependency or an algorithm
reimplemented from the upstream source, and each retains its own licence.

  @react-three/fiber, @react-three/drei, three, postprocessing
      MIT — pmndrs / three.js authors. Installed as dependencies.

  @shadergradient/react
      MIT — © ruucm. Installed as a dependency.

  liquid-glass-js  https://github.com/dashersw/liquid-glass-js
      MIT — © 2025 Armagan Amcalar.
      The rounded-rectangle SDF, displacement and edge/rim/base weighting are
      reimplemented in this project's own GLSL and CSS. None of the upstream
      JavaScript is included.

  liquid-logo  https://github.com/collidingScopes/liquid-logo
      MIT — © 2025 Alan Ang.
      The flow-field integration, edge-detect deflection and tone curve are
      reimplemented in this project's own GLSL. No asset from the upstream
      repository is included — it ships third-party trademarked logos, none of
      which are redistributed here. The wordmark mask is generated from live
      text at runtime.

  Space Grotesk — © Florian Karsten, SIL OFL 1.1.
  IBM Plex Mono  — © Mike Abbink, SIL OFL 1.1.
  Simplex noise (GLSL) — Ashima Arts / Stefan Gustavson, MIT.